  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nI like giving non Matrix Users the Opportunity looking into Public Matrix Rooms.\r\n\r\nThe Problem is that since a couple of time linking to an event didn't work anymore despite the Event is there.\r\n\r\nThought that this is an Element Bug because they aren't waiting long enough, but i was told that i am wrong:\r\nhttps://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/25330\r\n\r\nCouldn't test it with another Server, because i don't know another matrix server who has guests enabled.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nWhere are you starting? What can you see?\r\n    This link should be opened as guest User:\r\n    [https://matrix.to/#/!jqjYAhOIRvqbLqqsQs:matrix.org/$l00waANOlw7k0r\\_UlPt-2rjK-Oy1XDoHc2qEO2bX2X0?via=matrix.org&via=tchncs.de&via=sils.li](https://matrix.to/#/!jqjYAhOIRvqbLqqsQs:matrix.org/$l00waANOlw7k0r%5C_UlPt-2rjK-Oy1XDoHc2qEO2bX2X0?via=matrix.org&via=tchncs.de&via=sils.li)\r\n\r\nThis is e.G. the link in Element:\r\nhttps://app.element.io/#/room/!jqjYAhOIRvqbLqqsQs%3Amatrix.org/%24l00waANOlw7k0r_UlPt-2rjK-Oy1XDoHc2qEO2bX2X0?via=matrix.org&via=tchncs.de&via=sils.li\r\n\r\n### Homeserver\r\n\r\nmatrix.org\r\n\r\n### Synapse Version\r\n\r\n1.83.0rc1\r\n\r\n### Installation Method\r\n\r\nI don't know\r\n\r\n### Database\r\n\r\n?\r\n\r\n### Workers\r\n\r\nMultiple workers\r\n\r\n### Platform\r\n\r\n-\r\n\r\n### Configuration\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Relevant log output\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n-\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\r\n\r\n_No response_",
